
Reset; // Everything
Echo On

Set a To r/abc/i

Repeat 2 Times
    Assert a Is Defined
    Assert a.IsPattern()
    Assert a.clone().id() == a.id()
    Assert a.clone().id() != r/abc/i.id()
    Assert a.clone() == r/abc/i
    Assert a.clone() === r/abc/i
    // Make sure resetting caches does mess up extant regexs
    If ! $loop.last -> Reset Caches
End-Repeat
